\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {20}{\ignorespaces Mean predicted argument-frame probability for cases with a valid protest petition filed (Opposed) versus cases without (Uncontested). Bars compare how frequently each thematic frame appears in hearing testimony across the two groups.}}{43}{figure.20}%
